# The second home screen, PERFORM: HOME again from the tempo page; HOME once more, back. Its keys are the track mix (the
# GLO layer) without GLO; its knobs the FX knobs; the keys are the scale again on any other page.
wait 3000
expect view 0
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 38
# the keys: F3 mutes the kick, G3 the hats; the scale is not touched
tapkey 0
tapkey 2
wait 100
expect trkmute 3
expect pool 0x5AD
# F#3 solo of the kick (key 1), then reset all (E5, key 23)
tapkey 1
wait 100
expect trksolo 1
# (0.17.22) the hats', snare's and perc's black keys freeze a part: G#3 the bass (Pedal), A#3 the acid line, C#4 the pluck line; again lets go
expect pedal 0
tapkey 3
wait 100
expect pedal 1
tapkey 5
wait 100
expect par173 1
tapkey 8
wait 100
expect par175 1
expect trksolo 1
tapkey 3
tapkey 5
tapkey 8
wait 100
expect pedal 0
expect par173 0
expect par175 0
tapkey 23
wait 100
expect trkmute 0
expect trksolo 0
# a scene: stored by a hold, recalled by a tap, as on the GLO layer (C5, key 19)
tapkey 0
key 19 down
wait 800
key 19 up
wait 100
expect scenes 1
tapkey 0
wait 100
expect trkmute 0
tapkey 19
wait 100
shot perf_queued.png
wait 3000
expect trkmute 1
# (0.17.22) a SEL tap: the swell, the mood up over a bar and back over four (124 BPM: 1.9 s, 7.7 s)
expect mood 50
tap SEL
wait 1900
expect mood 80
wait 8000
expect mood 50
# (0.17.23) SEL + A#4 (key 17): the drums' next pattern; SEL + F#4 (key 13) a new acid line, F#5 (key 25) a new pluck line
expect par48 0
press SEL
tapkey 17
release SEL
wait 100
expect par48 1
press SEL
tapkey 13
tapkey 25
release SEL
wait 2000
expect playing 1
# the knobs: the FX knobs (crush up)
spin K2 25
wait 100
expect fxk1 25
shot perf_screen.png
# the DJ on (F5, key 24), its length (F#5), and the screen follows
tapkey 24
wait 3000
shot perf_dj.png
expect djon 1
# HOME again: back to the tempo page, where the keys play (0.17.6: not the scale)
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
tapkey 1
expect pool 0x5AD
# the dial from the perform screen goes on to the next page (HOME twice quickly would be the visualizers)
wait 600
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 38
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
expect view 1
# and from the Global page HOME is the tempo page
wait 600
tap GLO
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
